sequenceDiagram
    participant Host as Host (Klient 1)
    participant API as Backend REST
    participant Cache as Redis/Valkey
    participant Guest as Guest (Klient 2)
    participant WS as Backend Socket.IO

    Host->>API: POST /connections (haslo, dane urzadzenia)
    API->>Cache: Zapis sesji (TTL = 120s)
    API-->>Host: 200 OK + code + connectionUUID + token(HOST)

    Guest->>API: POST /connections/join (connectionCode, haslo, dane urzadzenia)
    API->>Cache: Walidacja kodu i statusu sesji
    API-->>Guest: 200 OK + connectionUUID + token(GUEST)

    Guest->>WS: connect (connectionToken=GUEST)
    Host->>WS: connect (connectionToken=HOST)
    Guest->>WS: connection:request-access
    WS-->>Host: connection:request-access

    alt Akceptacja
        Host-->>WS: connection:accept
        WS-->>Guest: connection:accepted
        Guest-->>Host: Wymiana WebRTC (offer/answer/ice-candidate)
    else Odrzucenie
        Host-->>WS: connection:reject
        WS-->>Guest: connection:rejected
    end

    opt Zakończenie sesji
        Host-->>WS: connection:disconnect
        WS->>WS: disconnectSockets(room)
        WS-->>Host: rozlaczenie transportowe socketu
        WS-->>Guest: rozlaczenie transportowe socketu
    end
